### 5. **src/Mod/Surface/App/Blending/FeatureBlendCurve.cpp:141** — Calls `getShape` (forces `NoElementMap`) instead of `getTopoShape`

**Failure scenario**: Similar to #4. `getShape` forces `NoElementMap`, clearing element tags. If downstream code (not shown in diff) depends on element mapping for the blend curve, it will fail.

```cpp
// Old: getTopoShape(...).getShape() — preserves element map
axEdge = Feature::getTopoShape(linked, ..., true).getShape();
// New: getShape — forces NoElementMap
axEdge = Part::Feature::getShape(linked, ..., NeedSubElement | ResolveLink | Transform);
```

